Package: delta.sharing
Type: Package
Title: Delta Sharing Client for R
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Authors@R: 
  c(
    person(given = "Zac",
           family = "Davies",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "zac@databricks.com"),
    person("Databricks", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: Provides immutable S7 descriptors for Delta Sharing clients,
  tables, snapshot reads, and change data feed specifications. R manages the
  control plane and snapshot planning. Snapshot row scans use a narrow Delta
  Kernel bridge and Arrow C Streams, with eager Arrow and data-frame adapters.
